# Ctrl+K finds a task by typing part of its name and Enter shows it under its project, focused.
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report
Home:
	Garden:
		- Plant tulips
		- Mow lawn
END
keys <C-k>
see Go to Symbol
type tulip
see - Plant tulips  Home › Garden
keys <Enter>
see › Home › Garden
hide Go to Symbol
keys x
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Write report
Home:
	Garden:
		- Plant tulips @done({today})
		- Mow lawn
END
